<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka exchange suspends Pugoda trade.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka exchange suspends Pugoda trade.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Pugoda Textiles Ltd has been suspended until further notice, a stock exchange official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have suspended trading in Pugoda from Friday until further notice, pending clarification from the company regarding developments which may be price sensitive,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>Pugoda Textiles shares last traded at 4.50 rupees on April 30.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
